[en.FOCUS_C12_PRACTICAL_ELECTRONIC]
Practical Electronic

[en.FOCUS_C12_PRACTICAL_ELECTRONIC_desc]
Through the portal to the Mirror World, the technology of electronic science was proposed and disseminated within a few years, reshaping our understanding of the world. In the future, we will explore how this technology will be applied to our lives and weapons.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_PRACTICAL_ELECTRONIC]
实用电子学

[zh.FOCUS_C12_PRACTICAL_ELECTRONIC_desc]
通过自由小马利亚的传送门，电子科技技术在数年内被提出和推广，并将在未来重塑我们对世界的了解，我们将研究出这种科技将如何应用在我们的生活和武器上。

